=== vpio-spike iteration 4/25 (20260722-161113) ===
Iteration complete. This iteration assessed **approach 2 (`AUVoiceProcessingIO` via AudioToolbox/ctypes)** — the first unchecked Phase 1 task — and concluded it is **reachable but inferior to approach 1, so not chosen**.

What was done:

- **Local probe** (`spike-vpio/probe_auvpio_ctypes.py`, pure ctypes, no new deps): the VoiceProcessingIO component can be found, instantiated, input-enabled, and initialized from Python — 4/4 checks passed with a clean process exit (no HAL hang like the last probe).
- **Why it's still the wrong path:** reachability was never the hard part. Driving this unit requires `AURenderCallback`s on the real-time audio thread, where a Python/ctypes callback must take the GIL — priority inversion and glitches by construction. Approach 1's `installTap` delivers buffers *off* the RT thread, which is exactly why the [Apple engineer in thread 733733](https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/733733) recommends AVAudioEngine + tap over raw CoreAudio. The only public ObjC AUGraph+VPIO example ([this gist](https://gist.github.com/d08f98b14328baa5eddbdf98d0ab8b91)) is itself broken ("Not being called at all" on its own callback), and [thread 651361](https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/651361) documents AudioUnit enumeration anomalies inside Python hosts. Approach 2 stays on file only as a fallback if approach 1's tap cadence fails in Phase 2.

Findings and sources are recorded in `SPIKE_PROGRESS.md`, checklist updated, and everything committed as `daedc5e`.

**Next iteration's task:** Phase 1, assess approach 4 (fallback) — the software WebRTC APM binding (`webrtc-audio-processing`) as a Pipecat `audio_in_filter`: does a maintained Apple Silicon Python binding exist, and can Pipecat's filter API supply the far-end playback reference?

Sources: [kAudioUnitSubType_VoiceProcessingIO docs](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/audiotoolbox/kaudiounitsubtype_voiceprocessingio), [Apple forums 733733](https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/733733), [Apple forums 651361](https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/651361), [VPIO AUGraph gist](https://gist.github.com/d08f98b14328baa5eddbdf98d0ab8b91)
